	<li style="margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="color:black"><span style="page-break-after:avoid"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,sans-serif">Match the AI task with the best compute:</span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,sans-serif"> cnvrg.io automates matching AI tasks with the best resource, whether it’s in the cloud or a data center.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
